  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 11,
    "summary": "David rejoices that the Lord is in His holy temple—The Lord tests the righteous and hates the wicked.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "In the Lord put I my trust: how say ye to my soul, Flee as a bird to your mountain?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 2,
            "text": "JST Ps. 11:1–5 (Appendix)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 58
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For, lo, the wicked bend their bow, they make ready their arrow upon the string, that they may privily shoot at the upright in heart.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 103,
            "end": 108,
            "text": "Ps. 64:4 (1–6)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 30
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "If the foundations be destroyed, what can the righteous do?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 7,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "TG Cornerstone."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord is in his holy temple, the Lord’s throne is in heaven: his eyes behold, his eyelids try, the children of men.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 49,
            "text": "TG Kingdom of God, in Heaven."
          },
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 62,
            "text": "TG Heaven."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 11
          },
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 52
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord trieth the righteous: but the wicked and him that loveth violence his soul hateth.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "TG Test."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Upon the wicked he shall rain snares, fire and brimstone, and an horrible tempest: this shall be the portion of their cup.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "Isa. 3:11 (9–11)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 83,
            "end": 96
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For the righteous Lord loveth righteousness; his countenance doth behold the upright.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 43,
            "text": "TG Righteousness."
          },
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 48,
            "text": "OR the upright shall behold His face."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
